ount we\u2019re working on.  First, are you calling as the host, the co-host, or someone helping, like your mom\u2019s delegate"},{"s":57.8,"e":58.4,"who":"user","text":"I\u2019m the co-host."},{"s":62.0,"e":73.8,"who":"agent","text":"Got it, thanks. It sounds like this is a Hearthway co-host issue on your mom\u2019s listing.  To find the right account, I\u2019ll need one identifier: either the email address on your account or the phone number. You"},{"s":73.8,"e":74.2,"who":"user","text":"The phone number is eight, two, eight, five, five, five, zero, one, seven, two."},{"s":82.6,"e":91.8,"who":"agent","text":"Okay, let me get that number clear in my head and confirm it back to you.I heard the phone number as 828-555-0172. Is that cor"},{"s":91.8,"e":92.2,"who":"user","text":"Yes."},{"s":94.6,"e":99.8,"who":"agent","text":"I have 8 2 8, 5 5 5, 0 1 7 2. Is tha"},{"s":99.8,"e":100.2,"who":"user","text":"Yes, that\u2019s correct."},{"s":104.0,"e":115.6,"who":"agent","text":"Thanks. I have the phone number as 8 2 8, 5 5 5, 0 1 7 2, and you confirmed that\u2019s correct.  I\u2019ve found an account that matches that number. Before I can talk about any listings, co-host assignments, or changes, I need to know your role and what you\u2019re trying to fix."},{"s":121.8,"e":122.2,"who":"user","text":"Sorry, could you finish that?"},{"s":126.0,"e":139.8,"who":"agent","text":"Thanks for hanging in there.  I\u2019ve located the account tied to that phone number. I can\u2019t read out internal details, but I can help with the co-host situation.  To fix a co-host mix-up, I need to know which listing you mean. \u201cMom\u2019s place\u201d coul"},{"s":139.8,"e":140.4,"who":"user","text":"Sorry, could you finish that?"},{"s":146.6,"e":147.2,"who":"agent","text":"I found an ac"},{"s":146.6,"e":147.2,"who":"user","text":"Could you finish that, please?"},{"s":149.4,"e":155.8,"who":"agent","text":"I found an account matching that phone number under Christina Moore. Before we go any further, are you Christina, the"},{"s":155.8,"e":156.4,"who":"user","text":"Yes, Christina Moore."},{"s":160.4,"e":165.8,"who":"agent","text":"Thanks, Christina. I\u2019ve pulled up your account, so now we just need to pin down which property you me"},{"s":165.8,"e":166.4,"who":"user","text":"Okay."},{"s":168.0,"e":175.8,"who":"agent","text":"Let\u2019s sort out what you\u2019re trying to change with the co-host setup, step by step.I found an account that matches the phone number you gave, bu"},{"s":175.8,"e":176.4,"who":"user","text":"Okay."},{"s":179.2,"e":181.8,"who":"agent","text":"I\u2019ve pulled up an account under the phone number you gave, and it matches a Christina Moore.  Before we do anything, I need to understand what you want to fix. Are you trying to confirm whether you\u2019re a co-host on a listing, add or remove a co-host, or check a mistake on a specific"},{"s":195.8,"e":196.4,"who":"user","text":"I need to identify the listing first."},{"s":203.0,"e":211.8,"who":"agent","text":"To identify the listing, I need a precise reference. Please tell me the property\u2019s street address and the city it\u2019s in, or the listing ID if you have"},{"s":212.2,"e":213.0,"who":"user","text":"418 Marbury Lane Unit 2B, Asheville."},{"s":218.4,"e":227.8,"who":"agent","text":"Let me locate that listing from the address you gave.I have the listing address as 418 Marbury Lane, Unit 2B, Asheville. Is that correct?"},{"s":227.8,"e":228.8,"who":"user","text":"No comma before the unit\u2014418 Marbury Lane Unit 2B, Asheville."},{"s":236.6,"e":237.8,"who":"agent","text":"I have 418 Marbury Lane, Unit 2B, Asheville. Is that cor"},{"s":241.8,"e":242.4,"who":"user","text":"The address is 418 Marbury Lane Unit 2B, Asheville."},{"s":252.0,"e":253.4,"who":"agent","text":"Thanks, I\u2019ve got the address confirmed\u2014now I\u2019ll check your co-host status for that listing. You\u2019re listed as an active co-host on that property, with a 15 percent payout share. If the mix-up is that you shouldn\u2019t be on it, or the share is wrong, that has to be hand"},{"s":267.8,"e":268.8,"who":"user","text":"I want to be taken off that one. My brother is handling it now."},{"s":273.4,"e":291.8,"who":"agent","text":"Okay, let\u2019s get clear on what removing you means and what I\u2019m allowed to do here.I can help with the request, but I need to be clear about what happens.  You\u2019re an active co-host on the listing at 418 Marbury Lane, Unit 2B in Asheville. Removing a co-host permanently ends that co-host\u2019s payout share on t"},{"s":291.8,"e":292.4,"who":"user","text":"uh-huh"},{"s":297.0,"e":306.6,"who":"agent","text":"I can help, but I need to be very clear about what this does.  Removing you as a co-host on that listing is permanent. It ends your payout share and your co-host role there, and adding you again later would create a new arrangement, not restore the old one.  You\u2019re currently ac"},{"s":315.8,"e":316.4,"who":"user","text":"So I can\u2019t just be put back on later if it doesn\u2019t work out?"},{"s":322.2,"e":323.8,"who":"agent","text":"Right. Removing a co-host is terminal for that arrangement. If you\u2019re removed, that payout share ends and it doesn\u2019t come back automatically if things change later. You could be invited again, but that would be a new setup, not a restoration.  Before anything happens, I\u2019d read back the"},{"s":339.8,"e":340.4,"who":"user","text":"Okay, do it."},{"s":345.4,"e":347.4,"who":"agent","text":"I\u2019m going to remove Christina Moore as a co-host from the listing at 418 Marbury Lane, Unit 2B in Asheville. This permanently ends your current payout share, and if you\u2019re added again later it would be a brand-new arrangement. You said \u201cdo it,\u201d so I\u2019ll go ahead now.All set. You\u2019ve been removed as a co-host on that listing, and your 15 percent payout share ended with that removal. If you\u2019re a"},{"s":371.8,"e":372.2,"who":"user","text":"Thank you. Goodbye. ###ST